    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE APRIL 25, 1954\nNORTHWEST\nOrient AIRLINES\nNew Dc-6B\nTOURIST\nSERVICE TO THE\nORIENT\nONLY\nWEST COAST $488\nTO TOKYO\n(Plus tax where applicable)\nFAMILY FARES\nONE\nWAY\nTAKE THE FAMILY WITH YOU\nAT 2 FARE\nMONDAY - TUESDAY - WEDNESDAY\nWhen you buy your ticket at regular one-way fares\nSee NWA or Your Travel Agent for Details\n- MONDAY • TUESDAY • WEDNESDAY",
      "INDIA\n•CAOUTTA\nSIAM\nNORTHWEST Orient AIRLINES\nSYSTEM MAP\nRoutes Operated\nProposed Routes\nRoutes Certified but not Operated\nConnecting Airlines\nThrough Plane Service\nCHINA\nNANKING\nSHANGHA\nHONG KONG\nMUKDEN\nHARBIN\nKOREA\nTOKYO\nJAPAN\nTHE PHILIPPINES\nHAWAIl\nNORTHWEST\nAIRVENTURES TO\nHawaii\nAlaska\nOrient\nBanff\nLake Louise\nYellowstone\nDude Ranches\nGlacier Park\nNew York\nWashington, D. C.\nRELAX AND ENJOY AN ALL-EXPENSE\nAIRVENTURE\nNorthwest Vacations by air, including hotels and sightseeing, are\npackaged by leading tour operators with a world of experience.\nTwo days in New York or Washington, D. C. for as low as $12.40\nor 5 days in Hawaii for $32 (plus air transportation). See your\nTravel Agent or Northwest Orient Airlines now for details of that\n\"Vacation of a Lifetime.\"\nNEW\nYORK\n12 Noon\nINTERNATIONAL TIME COMPARISONS\nMANILA\n(LOCAL TIMES)\nOKINAWA HONG\nKONG\nSEATTLE\nTAIPEI\nam ND\nam ND:\nNEW YORK\n12 Mant\nSEATTLE\n8om\n\" em\nOKINAWA HONG KONG\nPUSAN\n1 pm ND*\nTAIPEl\n4 pm SD\n4 pm SD*\nSD*\n10 pm\nALASKA\nCANADA\nRED LAKE\nGRAND FORKS\nSIOUX LOOKOUT\nFT. ARTHUR\nSASKATOON YORKTOWN\nPON REGINA\nSEATTLE TAGON\nPORTLAND,\nROCK SPRING:\nUNITED STATES\nSAN FRANCISCO\nLAS VEGAS\nSANTA FE\nLOS ANGELEC\nMore SPEED! More COMFORT!\nDC-6B NON-STOP TOURIST TO\nALASKA $75\nPlus Tax\nBetween Seattle-Tacoma and Anchorage"
    ],
